{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2014-10", "window": 2, "start_date": 1412726400, "end_date": 1413417599, "month_true_total": 243, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:09:05 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "12502403", "author": {"steamid": "76561198006693873", "personaname": "Jimmy Jazz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/LFJimmyJazz/", "num_games_owned": 800, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 4897, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3541, "last_played": 1619990391, "avatar": "7495be66b7f4462686c888bf95223d23d2ee1481"}, "language": "english", "review": "Really nice roguelike; the levels don't change much (there is a small number of patterns that combine themselves to create levels but after a few hours you'll realize the changes are small), but everything else is done pretty good; really high replayability.\nThe only real problem is the online coop: the game doesn't get advantage of Steam, and you have to use Hamachi to connect with your friends, wich can be frustrating. Aside from this, i higly recommend it!", "timestamp_created": 1413397692, "timestamp_updated": 1413397692, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "12496548", "author": {"steamid": "76561198002750621", "personaname": "Sugar Brock", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198002750621/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 34, "playtime_forever": 1514, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1256, "last_played": 1463715473, "avatar": "2ce7888e34fa2dd6c056e1cb35044ca44e284017"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's a turn-based strategy game. And, yes, Risk Of Rain can look seriously boring to the casual bystander, but for the person at the helm of the game every turn can lead to a weighty decision, giving the player a certain feeling of power that few, if any, games match.\n\nAlmost half-way through this review, and I’ve yet to mention gameplay. Maybe that’s a tacit criticism in itself. It’s not that Risk Of Rain's gameplay is substandard – far from it – but it’s always firmly in the service of its overarching narrative. Consequently, the game is heavily punctuated by cut scenes – some brief, some quite long. Cut scenes become engrossing, and it’s joy to see them bleed seamlessly into the furious action. \n\nCan't wait for Risk Of Rain 2: Over The Hill. 10/10", "timestamp_created": 1413354058, "timestamp_updated": 1413354058, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.492666691541671753", "comment_count": 4, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "12495017", "author": {"steamid": "76561198053846809", "personaname": "Th3DuckOnQuack", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/thisisatest/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 48, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 48, "last_played": 1394403103, "avatar": "d7b5d3af7827cfcc950138abab40c269e617c5ce"}, "language": "english", "review": "Weather outlook for the rest of the week: raining blood (because this game is pretty difficult).", "timestamp_created": 1413338356, "timestamp_updated": 1413338356, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date